{"id":"573838070","kind":"article","title":"迁移恰当加工","author":"Andy Matuschak","original_authors":["Andy Matuschak"],"original_source_urls":["https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zgNZJ2DNTzbNNriAGHjbKTowViNr6yCuk6D"],"publisher":"Jarrett Ye","column":"认知基石 & 教育培训","date":"2022-10-15","updated":"2025-07-16","votes":11,"comment_count":0,"minutes":2,"chars":994,"keywords":["迁移恰当加工","检索练习","测试效应","编码与提取","学习迁移"],"summary":"译文介绍迁移恰当加工：回忆表现受编码和提取任务是否匹配影响。作者引用课堂研究综述与实验指出，提取练习题型与最终测验题型匹配时效果最大，不匹配可能削弱表现；Morris 等人的实验还显示，押韵这种较浅加工在匹配识别任务中可能优于语义加工。作者提出真实情境迁移是否受异质题型帮助的问题，但未给出确定答案。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/573838070","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":2,"title":"链接至本文（已汉化）"},{"id":"sec-2","level":2,"title":"声明"}],"html":"<p data-pid=\"GPzNFvXE\">{迁移恰当加工}：当{提取涉及的加工类型与编码涉及的加工类型匹配}时，信息回忆得更好（e.g. Morris et al, 1977）</p><ul><li data-pid=\"nghR0GuG\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/Agarwal,_P._K.,_Nunes,_L._D.,_&amp;_Blunt,_J._R._(2021)._Retrieval_Practice_Consistently_Benefits_Student_Learning\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">A Systematic Review of Applied Research in Schools and Classrooms. Educational Psychology Review.</a> 的研究发现，当提取练习的模式（多项选择，简答题）与测试的模式匹配时，提取练习的效果最大——不匹配的模式可能会使效应量减半。<br/><br/></li><ul><li data-pid=\"cSlculqL\"> 但话说回来：谁在乎呢？考试不是最重要的，真正的能力才是最重要的。那么，如果我们在真实设定下查看<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z2hEyCHQpB6UV8z4mYvto7FJud4zWVqZqfxJZ\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">迁移学习</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>的结果，我们是否能发现在<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zFGWCfLsZMkwKPYG2F3k9mnpwWM9D6cEJXS\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">提取练习</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup>中加入异质的模式有更好的结果？这些更好的结果是否抵得上多项选择的经验/作者成本？例如：见<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z7MGZ4wX4fenUQzR9248QfWU8GFeZbTFGaJRM\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">自主评分的间隔重复记忆系统比机器评分的系统更有效率</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-3\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup><br/> <br/></li></ul><li data-pid=\"0kmF6vlv\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/Agarwal,_P._(2019)._Retrieval_Practice_&amp;_Bloom’s_Taxonomy\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Do Students Need Fact Knowledge Before Higher Order Learning? Journal of Educational Psychology, 111, 189–209</a><br/> </li><ul><li data-pid=\"Qo_lwnnf\"> 实验 1 发现在延迟事实测验中，高阶问题的提取练习与重新学习条件下的提取练习没有区别；在延迟高阶测验中，事实问题的提取练习也是如此。<br/> <br/></li><li data-pid=\"yKSztb2R\"> 总而言之，初始的提取练习增强了最终测试表现，但仅当初始测验类型（事实或高阶）与最终测试类型（分别为事实或高阶）匹配时。<br/> <br/></li><li data-pid=\"zTuICcGO\"> 其他两个实验与这一发现大致一致。<br/> </li></ul></ul><hr/><p data-pid=\"Uep36DSq\">问：Morris 等人（1977）是如何证明迁移恰当加工的？<br/>答：编码任务包括语义分析或押韵测试；识别任务要么涉及，要么不涉及押韵。编码任务和识别任务类型匹配时，表现最好。</p><p data-pid=\"nK-a7Osy\">问：迁移恰当加工的反直觉发现是什么（Morris 等人，1977）？<br/>答：当识别任务也涉及押韵时，押韵（即低加工深度）的习得任务比语义习得任务表现得更好。</p><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><h2 id=\"sec-1\">链接至本文（已汉化）</h2><ul><li data-pid=\"LIIvIg5c\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"423449068\" href=\"#/post/423449068\">测试效应</a></li><li data-pid=\"3taue1c7\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"503640236\" href=\"#/post/503640236\">COGS 101B - 第 19 课 - 长期记忆 - 编码、提取、巩固</a></li></ul><h2 id=\"sec-2\">声明</h2><p data-pid=\"a1kSLiu9\">此内容发布由 Andy Matuschak 许可。未经允许，不得转载或修改。保留所有权利。</p><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><blockquote data-pid=\"tK_Q4Oar\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>感谢主要译者 <a class=\"member_mention\" data-hash=\"fd3642075287be95e5f5d0eafbf1ac8c\" data-hovercard=\"p$b$fd3642075287be95e5f5d0eafbf1ac8c\" href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/people/fd3642075287be95e5f5d0eafbf1ac8c\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">@changxv</a> <br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zgNZJ2DNTzbNNriAGHjbKTowViNr6yCuk6D\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Transfer-appropriate processing (andymatuschak.org)</a></blockquote><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 迁移学习 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"491870061\" href=\"#/post/491870061\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-2\">↩</a> 提取练习 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"1928747840647168044\" href=\"#/post/1928747840647168044\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-3\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-3\">↩</a> 自主评分的间隔重复记忆系统比机器评分的系统更有效率 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"472256442\" href=\"#/post/472256442\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"571218385","title":"概念","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":10,"minutes":1,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · 认知基石 & 教育培训"},{"id":"574139400","title":"解释学","author":"Issa Rice","votes":16,"minutes":1,"reason":"同专栏下一篇 · 认知基石 & 教育培训"},{"id":"503640236","title":"COGS 101B - 第 19 课 - 长期记忆 - 编码、提取、巩固","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":17,"minutes":6,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"1928747840647168044","title":"提取练习","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":9,"minutes":1,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"423449068","title":"测试效应","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":37,"minutes":10,"reason":"本文直接引用"}],"rec_bridge":[],"rec_answers":[]}